","name":"Other","spdx_id":"NOASSERTION","url":null,"node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTA="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["c","client","curl","ftp","gopher","hacktoberfest","http","https","imaps","ldap","libcurl","library","mqtt","pop3","scp","sftp","transfer-data","transferring-data","user-agent","websocket"],"visibility":"public","forks":6982,"open_issues":25,"watchers":40144,"default_branch":"master","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"cURL 7.77.0 can crash(Segfault @Curl_ssl_getsessionid) then closing SSL connection.\r\nReproduced by PHP's curl H2 tests(Uses HTTP2 Push with multi interface and pipelining/multiplexing) on url https://http2.golang.org/serverpush. \r\nPHP Test: ext/curl/tests/bug77535.phpt\r\nVersion 7.75.0 works fine.\r\n\r\n### I did this\r\n\r\n### I expected the following\r\n\r\ncURL 7.77.0\r\n\r\n[curl -V output]\r\ncurl 7.77.0 (x86_64-pc-linux-gnu) libcurl/7.77.0 OpenSSL/1.1.1k zlib/1.2.11 zstd/1.5.0 libidn2/2.3.1 libssh2/1.9.0 nghttp2/1.43.0 OpenLDAP/2.4.58\r\nRelease-Date: 2021-05-26\r\nProtocols: dict file ftp ftps gopher gophers http https imap imaps ldap ldaps mqtt pop3 pop3s rtsp scp sftp smb smbs smtp smtps telnet tftp\r\nFeatures: alt-svc AsynchDNS Debug GSS-API HSTS HTTP2 HTTPS-proxy IDN IPv6 Kerberos Largefile libz NTLM NTLM_WB SPNEGO SSL TLS-SRP TrackMemory UnixSockets zstd\r\n### operating system\r\nCentOS 7.7\r\n3.10.0-1062.4.1.el7.x86_64 #1 SMP Fri Oct 18 17:15:30 UTC 2019 x86_64 x86_64 x86_64 GNU/Linux\r\n\r\n\r\nBacktrace:\r\n\r\n#0  0x00007fffe7c4527e in Curl_ssl_getsessionid (data=0x1351558, conn=0x12701c8, isProxy=false,\r\n    ssl_sessionid=0x7fffffff9db0, idsize=0x0, sockindex=0) at vtls/vtls.c:422\r\n#1  0x00007fffe7c43db1 in ossl_disassociate_connection (data=0x1351558, sockindex=0)\r\n    at vtls/openssl.c:4559\r\n#2  0x00007fffe7c45aa5 in Curl_ssl_detach_conn (data=0x1351558, conn=0x12701c8) at vtls/vtls.c:603\r\